[resource]
metadata/text = "Forest weather recordings\n\nLight rain: Arctura, CC BY 3.0\nhttps://freesound.org/people/Arctura/sounds/34065/\nHeavy rain: Q.K., CC0\nhttps://github.com/minetest-mods/mymonths/tree/master/sounds\nBoth recorded sources archived by t-affeldt / regional_weather.\nhttps://github.com/t-affeldt/regional_weather\n\nWooden creak/opening recording: CGEffex, modified by BlockMen, CC BY 3.0. From Minetest Game's doors mod.\nhttps://github.com/luanti-org/minetest_game/tree/master/mods/doors\n\nCC BY 3.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/\nCC0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\nEncoded recordings unchanged; wooden recording renamed and played quietly at bridges. No mod source code was copied. Exact revisions, hashes and original notices: assets/weather_human/\n\nExisting forest ambience, leaves, terrain and fonts retain their original credits above. Encounter sheet and Forest Capillaries supplied by the project creator."
